---
title: CFS 调度主流程(EEVDF)
type: flowchart
tags: [进程管理, 调度器, CFS, EEVDF]
description: 从 schedule() 入口到 context_switch() 的调度主调用链,pick_eevdf() 选 deadline 最小者
---
flowchart TD
    A["需要调度<br/>时钟 tick / 抢占 / 主动让出"] --> B["schedule()"]
    B --> C["__schedule(sched_mode)"]
    C --> D["pick_next_task(rq, rf)"]
    D --> E["__pick_next_task()"]
    E -->|当前类为 CFS| F["pick_task_fair()"]
    F --> G["pick_next_entity()"]
    G --> H["pick_eevdf()"]
    H --> I["entity_eligible() 过滤 eligible 实体"]
    I --> J["选出虚拟截止时间 deadline 最小者"]
    J -->|task_of(se) 返回 task_struct| K["context_switch()"]
    K --> L["finish_task_switch()"]
    L -->|next 进程开始运行| A
    N["说明——EEVDF 按 deadline 选任务<br/>vruntime 仍用于计算 lag 与 eligible 判断"] -.-> H
